Thus steps for each shift candidate:

- create_candidate (if not already)
- allocate_vehicle_unit
- attach_task_profile
- confirm_candidate_preparedness
- assign_operator_resource (need operator)
- assign_skill_certificate
- assign_compliance_certificate
- load_container_onto_leg (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_transport_leg_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_available, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not loading_container_loaded)
- stage_schedule_candidate (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_loaded, loading_container_leg_linked, candidate_task_profile_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not candidate_staged_for_loading)
- verify_loading_profile_nominal (requires candidate_staged_for_loading, candidate_skill_certificate_linked, candidate_operator_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_loading_verified)
- (now candidate_loading_verified true)
- establish_clearance_nominal (requires candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established)
- finalize_candidate_direct (requires candidate_clearance_established, not route_sequence_context_set, not candidate_finalized)
- allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate (requires dispatch_ready, candidate_task_profile_linked, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated)
- execute_schedule_dispatch (requires dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatched)

