17. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Preconditions: transport_leg_assembled, origin_availability_locked, candidate_task_profile_linked ?origin_availability ?route_task_profile, not transport_leg_loading_authorized.

We have origin_availability_locked true, we have candidate_task_profile_linked for origin_availability_alpha (we attached earlier). So ok.

Effect: transport_leg_loading_authorized.

Now we can mark origin and destination dispatch ready:

18. mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready origin_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha
Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready.

Effect: dispatch_ready.

19. mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready destination_availability_alpha transport_leg_alpha
Preconditions: destination_availability_locked, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready.

Effect: dispatch_ready.

Now we need to allocate dispatch slot for each and dispatch.

But we have only one dispatch slot; we will do sequentially.

First for origin_availability_alpha:

20. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions: dispatch_ready ?origin_availability_alpha, candidate_task_profile_linked ?origin_availability_alpha ?route_task_profile_alpha, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot_alpha, not dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability_alpha.

We have dispatch_ready true, candidate_task_profile_linked true (we attached earlier), dispatch_slot_available true (init), not dispatch_allocated.

Effect: dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability_alpha, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability_alpha ?dispatch_slot_alpha, not dispatch_slot_available.

Now we need to have vehicle allocated and linked for origin_availability_alpha. We already allocated vehicle earlier (step 2) and attached vehicle? Wait allocate_vehicle_unit gives candidate_vehicle_linked. So we have candidate_vehicle_linked.

Thus we can execute origin dispatch:

21. execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha
Preconditions: dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability_alpha, candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability_alpha ?vehicle_unit_alpha, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability_alpha ?dispatch_slot_alpha, not dispatched ?origin_availability_alpha.

Effect: dispatched ?origin_availability_alpha, vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit_alpha, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot_alpha.

Now vehicle_unit_alpha becomes available again, dispatch_slot becomes available.

Now we need to dispatch destination_availability_alpha. We need to allocate dispatch slot again (now available). However we need to ensure destination_availability_alpha has dispatch_allocated and candidate_vehicle_linked etc. We already allocated vehicle for destination earlier (step 10) and attached task profile, etc. We have not allocated dispatch slot for destination yet.

Thus:

22. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate destination_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions: dispatch_ready true (we set), candidate_task_profile_linked true, dispatch_slot_available true (now), not dispatch_allocated.

Effect: dispatch_allocated, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatch_slot_available.

23. execute_destination_dispatch destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_beta dispatch_slot_alpha
Preconditions: dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked (we allocated vehicle_unit_beta), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatched.

Effect: dispatched destination_availability_alpha, vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta, dispatch_slot_available.

Now we have dispatched origin and destination availability.

Now we need to handle shift_candidate_alpha and shift_candidate_beta.

We need to prepare them similarly but with extra steps for loading verification etc.

We also need to have transport leg assembled and loading authorized (already done). Good.

We need to assign operator, skill certificate, compliance certificate to each shift candidate.

We have one operator; we'll assign, use, release.

We have one skill certificate; assign, use, release.

We have one compliance certificate; assign, use, release.

We have two loading containers: alpha and beta.

We need to load each container onto leg before staging each candidate. However note that loading container onto leg requires loading_container_available. After we load alpha, alpha becomes not available. Beta still available. After we load beta, beta becomes not available. After both loaded, both containers are not available. That's fine.

We need to load container onto leg for each candidate before staging.

Thus we will do for shift_candidate_alpha:

First, ensure candidate created etc. We have init: candidate_origin_availability_linked etc but not candidate_created. So we need create.

24. create_candidate shift_candidate_alpha

25. allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma (we have gamma free)

26. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

27. confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha

Now we need to assign operator, skill, compliance.

But we need operator for verify_loading_profile_nominal. We'll assign operator now.

28. assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha

29. assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha

30. assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha

Now we need to load container onto leg for this candidate. We'll load loading_container_alpha.

Preconditions for load_container_onto_leg: candidate_prepared (yes), candidate_transport_leg_linked (we have from init), candidate_loading_container_linked (we have init linking shift_candidate_alpha to loading_container_alpha), loading_container_available (alpha is available initially), transport_leg_assembled (yes), transport_leg_loading_authorized (yes), not loading_container_loaded (alpha not loaded yet).

Thus:

31. load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha

Effect: loading_container_loaded alpha, loading_container_leg_linked alpha leg, not loading_container_available alpha.

Now we need to stage schedule candidate:

32. stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_prepared (yes), candidate_loading_container_linked (yes), loading_container_loaded (yes), loading_container_leg_linked (yes), candidate_task_profile_linked (yes), not origin_leg_loaded (true, we have not loaded cargo), not candidate_staged_for_loading (false yet).

Effect: candidate_staged_for_loading.

Now verify loading profile nominal:

33. verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_staged_for_loading (yes), candidate_skill_certificate_linked (yes), candidate_operator_linked (yes), candidate_loading_container_linked (yes), loading_container_leg_linked (yes), destination_leg_loaded (false), not candidate_loading_verified (false yet).

Effect: candidate_loading_verified.

Now we can establish clearance nominal:

34. establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_loading_verified (yes), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked (yes), candidate_loading_container_linked (yes), loading_container_leg_linked (yes), not origin_leg_loaded (true), not destination_leg_loaded (true), not candidate_clearance_established (false yet).

Effect: candidate_clearance_established.

Now we can finalize candidate direct:

35. finalize_candidate_direct shift_candidate_alpha
Preconditions: candidate_clearance_established (yes), not route_sequence_context_set (we never set), not candidate_finalized (false yet).

Effect: candidate_finalized, dispatch_ready.

Now we need to allocate dispatch slot and dispatch.

But before that, we need to ensure candidate_vehicle_linked (we allocated vehicle gamma earlier) and we have not yet allocated dispatch slot.

Now we need to release operator, skill certificate, compliance certificate after we are done with them? Not required for dispatch but to make them available for next candidate. We'll release after we have used them for this candidate, before we need them for next candidate.

Thus after step 34 or 35 we can release.

But note: finalize_candidate_direct does not affect those links. So we can release after.

Thus:

36. release_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha
Effect: operator_available, not candidate_operator_linked.

37. release_skill_certificate shift_candidate